# fails on it for the same reason, and the only "fix" npm offers is a
# downgrade of cdk-dia to 0.11.0, which predates the aws-cdk-lib dependency
# and does not render this repository's stacks.
#
# Not clearable by a pin bump: re-checked 2026-11-01 by reading the
# package.json files inside the published aws-cdk-lib 2.275.0 tarball (the
# newest release, 2026-10-26, and the one this repository's lock now
# resolves). It moved its bundled minimatch from 10.2.5 to 10.2.6, still on
# the unfixed 10.x line, and its bundled brace-expansion from 5.0.9 to 5.0.12,
# which retired the GHSA-6j4f-fj2g-mc7p, GHSA-q2hr-2g5m-vwhr and
# GHSA-qhr7-859c-m2p7 entries this file used to carry.
#
